    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if it's not just exhaustion? what if the well is actually just dry? i feel like i'm just walking through a hollow shell of a life now. there's no point in waiting for a \"drop\" if the well is dead. it's just... heavy. and pointless.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
